  <math|f<around*|(|x|)>=x<rsup|3>-3x<rsup|2>+x+3>,

  variations : <math|f<rprime|'><around*|(|x|)>=3x<rsup|2>-6x+1>

  signe : <math|\<Delta\>=<around*|(|-6|)><rsup|2>-4\<times\>3=24\<gtr\>0> 2
  racines <math|x<rsub|1>=<dfrac|6-2<sqrt|6>|2\<times\>3>=<dfrac|3-<sqrt|6>|3>>

  et <math|x<rsub|2>=<frac|3+<sqrt|6>|3>>

